## Rules

1. **Do not grow** `lib/app/nav-config.ts` as a parallel mega-register for Customer APP menu.
2. Menu visibility requires **readiness + role + entitlement/feature/permission** via `filterNavGroupsByAccess` / `resolveCanonicalNavVisibility`.
3. **Foundation / unready routes stay hidden** from the main menu (`APP_ROUTE_READINESS` status `hidden`). Do not delete route code just to hide them.
4. Products **without entitlement** appear in the **software catalog** (`/app/software`), not as half-finished main-menu items.
5. **No new commerce tables**, package/module/license/entitlement models, or invoice systems in APP.
6. `billing_history` is **not** an invoice list. Platform owns invoices.
7. Catalog is **read-only** in this foundation — no purchase mutation, no client-side activation.
8. Use canonical **`aipify_hosts`** for hospitality pack presentation — never invent an “Airbnb Operations” SKU or hardcode customer/provider product logic.
9. **No runtime fixtures** for catalog data. Degrade on RPC failure without inventing prices/status.
10. Preview/Production proof must use **actual routes**, not component-only screenshots.

